    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive, Escape, Win!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a dark and sinister world. There is only one way to freedom: Pass the traps, solve the password and ESCAPE before the creature catches you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESC4PE!</strong> is a survival and escape game with action, suspense and horror for 1 to 4 players. When the game starts, the doors are locked and the path to each trap is blocked. To open these doors, you need to find and activate the right 4 switches from the switches scattered in different parts of the map. These switches will lead you to areas full of deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each trap is a different test!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflexes, attention and teamwork are vital here. Each time you pass a trap, you get one digit of the 4-digit password. When you successfully pass all the traps and complete the password, the final step awaits you: Enter the password correctly and GET FREEDOM!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But ATTENTION!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the while, a mysterious creature is on the prowl to hunt you down. When you hear his voice, hide, lose him, or change your path. Or it could all be over in an instant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every game, a brand new challenge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two escapes are the same in <strong>ESC4PE!</strong> Each time a randomly generated password leads you to different traps. The structure and difficulty of these traps change according to the difficulty level chosen. Each map offers a completely different experience with its own unique atmosphere and design. And each one brings its own darkness and a different predator. Each creature, in its own way, watches you, smells you, finds you. This makes every game experience fresh, dynamic and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESC4PE! offers you the following:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 player online co-op gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleverly designed traps and a password system to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic world of fear and suspense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced escape experience that requires teamwork and individual skill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Together or alone, your survival is in your hands!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your every decision will determine your fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAN YOU ESCAPE?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive, Escape, Win!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a dark and sinister world. There is only one way to freedom: Pass the traps, solve the password and ESCAPE before the creature catches you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESC4PE!</strong> is a survival and escape game with action, suspense and horror for 1 to 4 players. When the game starts, the doors are locked and the path to each trap is blocked. To open these doors, you need to find and activate the right 4 switches from the switches scattered in different parts of the map. These switches will lead you to areas full of deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each trap is a different test!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflexes, attention and teamwork are vital here. Each time you pass a trap, you get one digit of the 4-digit password. When you successfully pass all the traps and complete the password, the final step awaits you: Enter the password correctly and GET FREEDOM!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But ATTENTION!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the while, a mysterious creature is on the prowl to hunt you down. When you hear his voice, hide, lose him, or change your path. Or it could all be over in an instant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every game, a brand new challenge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two escapes are the same in <strong>ESC4PE!</strong> Each time a randomly generated password leads you to different traps. The structure and difficulty of these traps change according to the difficulty level chosen. Each map offers a completely different experience with its own unique atmosphere and design. And each one brings its own darkness and a different predator. Each creature, in its own way, watches you, smells you, finds you. This makes every game experience fresh, dynamic and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESC4PE! offers you the following:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 player online co-op gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleverly designed traps and a password system to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic world of fear and suspense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced escape experience that requires teamwork and individual skill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Together or alone, your survival is in your hands!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your every decision will determine your fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAN YOU ESCAPE?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "ESC4PE! is a 1-4 player action-thriller, horror and survival game. Navigate deadly traps, solve the codes, and escape through maps with unique themes. But be careful\u2026 the creature\u2019s hungry, and you might just be dinner. CHOMP!",
